  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Fallen Flower Hall is in crisis, Chen Yi of Heavenly Lotus Sect sees Fang clan reinforcements arrive as high tier rank seven Immortal Gu Houses Chicken Dog Coop and Inquiry Dock, and fears that joining Fallen Flower Hall would create the battlefield killer move peach blossom maze.",
      "chapters": [
        1518
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_fallen_flower_hall",
        "char_chen_yi",
        "fac_heavenly_lotus_sect",
        "fac_fang_clan",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "house_chicken_dog_coop",
        "move_peach_blossom_maze"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After they reach the field, Fang clan has three Immortal Gu Houses: Fallen Flower Hall, Chicken Dog Coop, and Inquiry Dock, and those three can form peach blossom maze.",
      "chapters": [
        1519
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Inquiry Dock flies after Divine Bean Palace while Chicken Dog Coop stays behind with Fallen Flower Hall.",
      "chapters": [
        1519
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_divine_bean_palace"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "From Inquiry Dock, Fang Di Chang reports that Divine Bean Palace was tracked but not caught, and that Fang clan must repair Fallen Flower Hall and combine all three houses into peach blossom maze to trap it.",
      "chapters": [
        1520
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_di_chang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Deviation (recorded): this page is filed under gu-houses because Inquiry Dock is a named Immortal Gu House. It is mobile equipment of Fang clan, not a five-region map seat.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Di Chang invites Fang Yuan into Inquiry Dock for help obtaining Divine Bean Palace, and lets him take part in controlling the house while Fang Di Chang and other Fang clan Gu Immortals lead that control. Fang Di Chang argues that an alliance agreement, the gap between theory and practice, and Inquiry Dock’s evolving design make that exposure acceptable.",
      "chapters": [
        1521
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "control-arrangement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Di Chang states that Inquiry Dock has a method to communicate with the outside world and uses a killer move to retrieve a rank seven Immortal Gu from Fang clan headquarters into Inquiry Dock.",
      "chapters": [
        1524
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "outside-communication",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fang clan obtains Divine Bean Palace, Inquiry Dock and Chicken Dog Coop are both heavily damaged.",
      "chapters": [
        1530
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "house-damage",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Edge Link Camp rushes Inquiry Dock under the amplification of heroes among people, Inquiry Dock is an information path Immortal Gu House that cannot resist that fierce attack alone. Fang Di Chang orders a rescue because Fang clan’s three Immortal Gu Houses need Inquiry Dock to use peach blossom maze.",
      "chapters": [
        1933
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "edge-link-camp-clash",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_edge_link_camp"
      ]
    }
  ],
